Z||000015||Adrift||06-30-2001||12:52 AM||||Here is the<A HREF="http://www.trader.ca/Search/Details.asp?UID=96D292F8615E11D59BA70002A5293128&CAT=1" TARGET=_blank>Autotrader Link</A><P>and here's the photo:<P><BR>if you want to do a convertable I really recommend you talk to some kit car people.. <A HREF="http://www.ifgonline.com" TARGET=_blank>www.ifgonline.com</A>  for example. Most Ferrari / Lambo replicas require you to cut the top, which requires the chasis to be strengthed. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/06-22-01lam31-10.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>My Dream Fiero, you ask?<BR>That would be a automatic '86 or newer V6 GT Fastback with T-Tops and A/C, fully running and for sale for under $1000 CAN. Know someone who's selling a car like this for this price in the Toronto area? PLEASE E-MAIL ME!!!||||reg||1
